OL,3,GNEWSATeens found guilty of murdering
OL,4,Aboy,15, in park
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenage boys have been convicted of
OL,7,Fmurdering a 15-year-old boy in a
OL,8,Fdispute over #40.
OL,10,FThe 16-year-old boys lured Luis Guembes
OL,11,Fto Stoke Park in Guildford in January
OL,12,Fthen stabbed him to death.
OL,14,FA jury at Guildford Crown Court found
OL,15,Fthe defendants, aged 15 and 16 at the
OL,16,Ftime of the attack, guilty of murder on
OL,17,FTuesday.
OL,19,FTheir trial heard the boys had agreed
OL,20,Fto rob Guembes in order to settle "a
OL,21,Fdebt he owed concerning a broken mobile
OL,22,Fphone".
